!Sample_data_processing = Peakcalling was done using MACS2 FDR cut off 5% with broad peak and narrow peak option for H3K27ac and MEF2C, respectively
!Sample_data_processing = The H3K27ac peaks in knockout experiment or HG-9-91-01 treatment experiment were merged with corresponding control ChIP-seq using BEDtools
!Sample_data_processing = Normalized tag count was calculated using Bamliquidator package
!Sample_data_processing = Genome_build: hg19
